{"articleNo":"397631","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=397631&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] [수업] 2022학년도 2학기 수강권 매매 행위 금지 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.08.25","hit":"12930","attachments":[{"name":"2.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=397631&attachNo=115755"},{"name":"1.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=397631&attachNo=115756"},{"name":"3.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=397631&attachNo=115758"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">이번&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">학년도&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">학기 수강신청과 관련하여 학생 여러분께 당부말씀 드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">일부 학생이 수강신청 과목을 다른 웹사이트에 올려<b>&nbsp;수강권을 사고 파는 글이 오가는 상황이 발생</b>하였습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">이는 실제 수강 의지 없이 금전적 이익을 목적으로 강의를 신청해두는 것으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b>수강신청제도를 악용하여 타인의 수강권리를 침해하는 행위</b>입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">우리대학은 이에 대한 문제를 심각하게 인식하고 있으며&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b>수강권 매매 행위는 학생상벌규정에 의거하여 징계 대상</b>이 될 수 있음을 안내드리니 이점 유념하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">본교 전산시스템에서는 수강신청과 관련된&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">모든 로그기록이 남으므로 신청 및 삭제기록 분석</span></b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">, IP</span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">추적을 통해 매매하는 행위가 적발 가능</span></b>하므로 유의하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gungsuh, 궁서, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2022. 8. 25.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b style=\"font-family: Gungsuh, 궁서, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">교 무 처 장</b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
